1.0.X | 2026-11-19
  * source and dest port remove as not applicable for most L2 and Other IP protocol
  * uid in conn.log format with prifix OC
  * orig_bytes,orig_ip_bytes - same value frame bytes - eht header len same as conn.log
    similarly for resp_bytes,resp_ip_bytes 

1.0.0 | 2026-10-07

  * Initial public release.
  * Logs non-TCP/UDP/ICMP IP traffic and pure L2 / non-IP Ethernet frames
    to other_conn.log, aggregated into bidirectional flows.
